    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectVisible? THEN\n\t\t\tDO ApproachObject\n\tELSE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectAtReach? THEN\n\t\t\tDO PickupObject\n\tELSE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectHeavy? THEN\n\t\t\tDO MoveObjectToDesignatedPoint\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO ProcessObjectTasks\n\tEND\n"
